s allege  was a night of drunken hazing the 19  year olds blood alcohol content was  estimated at roughly four times the  legal limit he fell down a flight of  stairs and hit his head  repeatedly often in view of his  fraternity brothers no one called for  help until the following morning he was  unconscious this hearing is supposed to  last until Friday to give all those  remaining defense attorneys a chance to  cross-examine the lead investigator but  if prosecutors decide to requestion that  witness or defense attorneys file new  motions it could be a while before we  find out when and if this will all move  to trial glad thanks Anna
 

